  <ferc:NotesToFinancialStatementsTextBlock id="f101" contextRef="c1">&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 107.9%;margin-bottom: 8pt;margin-top: 0;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;;display:inline;"&gt;1&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;;display:inline;"&gt;&lt;div style="spacecount: 10;;display:inline;"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;;display:inline;"&gt;&lt;div style="spacecount: 10;;display:inline;"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;;display:inline;"&gt;BALANCE SHEET&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;;display:inline;"&gt;&lt;div style="spacecount: 10;;display:inline;"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-size: 14pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;;display:inline;"&gt;&lt;div style="spacecount: 10;;display:inline;"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;line-height: 107.9%;margin-bottom: 8pt;margin-top: 0;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;;display:inline;"&gt;At March 31, 2026 the provision for the asset retirement obligation for the Endicott Pipeline was $8,453,405.&amp;#160;&amp;#160;The provision has been estimated using existing technology, at current prices and is expected to be incurred over the next 16.75 years.&amp;#160;&amp;#160;While the provision is based on the best estimate of future costs and the economic lives of the pipeline, there is uncertainty regarding both the amount and timing of incurring these costs.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;table style="border: none;border-collapse: collapse;margin-bottom: .001pt;width: 3.51in;"&gt;&lt;tr style="height: 0.21in;"&gt;&lt;td style="background: #dce6f1;border-bottom: solid #ffffff 1.0pt;border-left-style: none;border-right: solid #ffffff 1.0pt;border-top: solid #ffffff 1.0pt;padding-bottom: 0;padding-left: 5.4pt;padding-right: 5.4pt;padding-top: 0;vertical-align: bottom;width: 99pt;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;calibri&#39;;font-size: 10pt;line-height: 107.9%;margin-bottom: 8pt;margin-top: 0;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;;display:inline;"&gt;&lt;div style="spacecount: 10;;display:inline;"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;a style="text-decoration: none;"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="background: #dce6f1;border-bottom: solid #ffffff 1.0pt;border-left: solid #ffffff 1.0pt;border-right: solid #ffffff 1.0pt;border-top: solid #ffffff 1.0pt;padding-bottom: 0;padding-left: 5.4pt;padding-right: 5.4pt;padding-top: 0;vertical-align: bottom;width: 13.5pt;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;calibri&#39;;font-size: 10pt;line-height: 107.9%;margin-bottom: 8pt;margin-top: 0;"&gt;&lt;div  style="font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;;display:inline;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="background: #dce6f1;border-bottom: solid #ffffff 1.0pt;border-left: solid #ffffff 1.0pt;border-right: solid #ffffff 1.0pt;border-top: solid #ffffff 1.0pt;padding-bottom: 0;padding-left: 5.4pt;padding-right: 5.4pt;padding-top: 0;vertical-align: top;width: 73.5pt;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 8pt;line-height: 107.9%;margin-bottom: 8pt;margin-top: 0;text-align: